  "bio": "La Jacinto is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Oviedo, Spain, renowned for their mastery in illustrative styles. They captivate their clients with stunning designs that intricately weave together vibrant, fruity gradient rainbow colors, delivering each piece with the utmost professionalism. Whether you're seeking a tattoo that's bold and colorful or subtle and sophisticated, La Jacinto's exceptional talent ensures a piece of art that is both personal and extraordinary.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Oviedo, Principality Of Asturias, Spain\n\nvintage & arty \n✦ artist mam | Oviedo @geiser.uvieu  \n✦ flash & custom @lajcnt_flash",
